context:
DELETE /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/spectrum/apps/{app_id}
Deletes a previously existing application.
Required: app_id (path); zone_id (path)

GET /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/spectrum/apps/{app_id}
Gets the application configuration of a specific application inside a zone.
Required: app_id (path); zone_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/spectrum/apps/{app_id}
Updates a previously existing application's configuration that uses a name for the origin.
Required: app_id (path); zone_id (path); body (body)
